      "uid": "zhcn:78326bfc215086ed815a2efc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但到此为止了！我不会容许你再逼近我分毫！\n哈啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc5d2aa99e5a5ee363b77caceeb3a286af09644990de97e4af0cbff28329636f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
